sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller
    participant Proxy as InstrumentedGraph
    participant Runtime as XAIRuntime
    participant Graph as LangGraph graph
    participant Handler as Callback handler
    participant Sinks as Store + observability

    Caller->>Proxy: ainvoke(input, config)
    opt Checkpointed thread, input is None or a Command
        Proxy->>Graph: aget_state(config)
    end
    Proxy->>Runtime: start_run(config, continuation_of)
    Runtime->>Sinks: Execution (running), execution.started
    opt Continuing a thread
        Proxy->>Runtime: record_checkpoint (restored), resume interaction
    end
    Proxy->>Graph: ainvoke(input, config + handler + run ID)
    loop Every node, tool, and retriever
        Graph->>Handler: on_chain_start / on_tool_end / on_retriever_end ...
        Handler->>Runtime: record_state_delta, record_node, record_tool, record_retrieval
        Runtime->>Sinks: state.transition, node.execution, tool.execution, ...
    end
    Note over Graph,Handler: Nodes may also call<br/>record_evidence and record_decision
    Graph-->>Proxy: output, exception, or interrupt
    opt Checkpointed thread, call not cancelled
        Proxy->>Graph: aget_state(config)
        Proxy->>Runtime: record_checkpoint (last written)
    end
    Proxy->>Runtime: finish_run(..., interrupts, pending_nodes)
    Runtime->>Sinks: execution.completed / execution.failed / interrupt, final Execution
    Proxy-->>Caller: the graph's output, unchanged
